224
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:16,080
Begin in medias res, which is Latin for in the midst of things.

225
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:20,080
You must grab your reader by the throat from word one.

226
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:26,080
That doesn't necessarily mean with bullets flying or a high-speed chase, though that might work for a thriller.

227
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,080
But it does mean avoiding too much scene setting.

228
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:34,080
And description instead of getting to the good stuff, the guts of the story.

229
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:41,080
The goal of every sentence, in fact of every word, is to force the reader to read the next.

230
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:45,080
You do this from the get-go by writing a great opener.

